      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The man is mapped as 'dat ass'",
      "description": "The text 'dat ass' is overlaid on the image of sheep with their rear ends prominently displayed. This creates an analogical mapping where the sheep's butts are being mapped as 'dat ass', and this mapping is then projected onto the man in the headscarf, who is visually positioned as the recipient of this degrading label. The man's shocked expression reinforces the implication that he is being mocked as 'dat ass' through the visual metaphor of the sheep butts.",
