      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme uses a degrading visual metaphor (sheep butts) and text ('dat ass') to mock a man perceived as Middle Eastern or Muslim, projecting a hateful stereotype that equates him with animal treatment and 'backward culture'. The distorted text 'ahmarbkrich d' further reinforces the dehumanizing projection. This constitutes a direct attack based on protected characteristics (religion/ethnicity).",
