    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_91069f07",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who hold or are exposed to Islamophobic stereotypes, particularly those who may find humor or satisfaction in mocking people of Middle Eastern or Muslim appearance. The meme is designed to provoke negative reactions toward this group by using degrading visual metaphors (sheep butts) and distorted text ('ahmarbkrich d') to imply that the man in the headscarf is 'dat ass' — a projection rooted in the 'backward culture' and 'animal treatment' accusations commonly used in Islamophobic rhetoric. The intended audience likely includes those who identify with or support such stereotypes, or who are seeking to reinforce or spread them through humor or shock value.",
